Package: represolve
Type: Package
Title: Replicate-Resolved Masked-Gene Completion Benchmarking and Regime Routing
Version: 1.0.3
Authors@R: person("Haitao", "Ren", email = "renhaitao@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Evaluates single-cell perturbation-response predictors by
    fold-frozen masked-gene completion against independent replicate
    measurement partitions (guides, cell pools, batches, or biological
    replicates), with prediction-time reliability and perturbation-density
    diagnostics, hard and soft regime routing, paired bootstrap confidence
    intervals, and fixed-size permutation-null calibration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
URL: https://github.com/rht888666/represolve, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24409221
BugReports: https://github.com/rht888666/represolve/issues
NeedsCompilation: no
